{"canonicalKey":"ethics.three_win","contentHash":"b1298be20f66243768f90f99137901bc4469fe4bd50c9e6bace5a4cae43444fd","contentType":"original_synthesis","formalTheoryChunk":false,"schemaVersion":"xinzhili.chunk-preview.v1","sourceKind":"card","status":"draft","text":"三赢：自己、他人与更大系统。决策可同时检查对自己、相关他人和更大系统的影响；三赢是审视框架，不保证不存在取舍。"}
